// The desk is the crowded-month serialiser, but January, May, August 2020 and
// July 2021 already chain their files head-to-tail, and November 2020 is
// sequenced by the router's own conditions. September 2020 is the only month
// where two dated files are open with nothing chaining them, so it is the only
// month that hands the router to the desk. Anything wider makes the desk
// compete with a chained branch, and Dendry resolves competing go-to branches
// at random.
// Months that hold more than one open legacy file and have nothing chaining
